'''Onmyoji Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] increases health and has a guaranteed chance of [[Weaken|weakening]] non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] of [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Onmyoji Cat was given [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] target and [[Zombie Killer]] abilities.

