==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Onmyoji Cat was a part of three [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Five Hearts (Removed Combo)|Five Hearts]], [[Witch Please (Removed Combo)|Witch Please]] and [[Bustin' Ghosts (Removed Combo)|Bustin' Ghosts]].
*Onmyoji Cat's Japanese description could be a reference to the ''Back to the Future'' series, which features a [[wikipedia:DMC DeLorean|DMC DeLorean]] sports car capable of time travelling.
*Magica Cat's hairstyle and outfit are identical to Creamy Mami's from ''[[wikipedia:Creamy Mami, the Magic Angel|Creamy Mami, the Magic Angel]]''; albeit grayscale and cat-sized.
**In fact, in [[Nyanko Defence Force]], her hair was the same exact color as Creamy Mami's.
**Magica Cat may also reference [https://elwiki.net/w/Aisha Aisha] from ''[[wikipedia:Elsword|Elsword]].''
*Magica Cat's alien contract may be a direct reference to the 'magical girls' in ''[[wikipedia:Puella Magi Madoka Magica|Madoka Magica]]''.
*Thaumaturge Cat's design is a combination of the ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Quest|Dragon Quest]]'' characters [[wikia:dragonquest:Hargon|Hargon]] (same shroud and pose) and the [[wikia:dragonquest:Dragonlord|Dragonlord]] (same horns).
**Thaumaturge Cat's design may also take inspiration from [[wikipedia:Maleficent|Maleficent]] from [[wikipedia:The Walt Disney Company|Disney]]'s ''[[wikipedia:Sleeping Beauty (1959 film)|Sleeping Beauty]]''.
*Thaumaturge Cat's staff resembles Kukuri's from ''[[wikipedia:Magical Circle Guru Guru|Magical Circle Guru Guru]]'', as well as the "evil eye" associated with [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies.
*[[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] increased Thaumaturge Cat's attack power by about 21%.

